0", "image": "engenn7le09ob04re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn7le09ob04re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand:</span> Thanks for mentoring me, Rocco.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Rocco:</span> My pleasure, young man. Today, I would like to tell you how to budget money.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand:</span> I'm all ears. Should I take notes?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Rocco:</span> Yes. This will help you crush outstanding debt, and take charge of the company's financial future.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand:</span> That's good. I have been told I don't make very effective financial decisions."}, {"time": "20000", "image": "engenn7le09ob04re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Rocco:</span> You will after this. Now, first of all, you need to start tracking your spending history.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand:</span> What does that mean?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Rocco:</span> Basically, collecting past bills, bank and credit card statements, and receipts. Then, put them all together and you will get an estimate of monthly spendings. Are you with me?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand:</span> Yes. Please, go on!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Rocco:</span> Next, you should consider using a software program to help you budget."}, {"time": "46000", "image": "engenn7le09ob04re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand:</span> What do you suggest?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Rocco:</span> There are tons of financial software programs. It is the new trend in finance. They have built-in budget-making tools, as well as analytics to help project your cash-flow.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand:</span> That sounds great! Am I going to look into that right now?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Rocco:</span> I am not done yet! ...  After that, determine your overall monthly revenue. Finally, analyze your revenue and expenses. If your expenses are greater than your revenue, you're spending too much.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand:</span> Thanks for the instructions. I will learn from that."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "400", "image": "", "id": 1, "text": "Giving Oral Instuctions"}, {"time": "13000", "image": "", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">Decide on the topic.</span>"}, {"time": "26000", "image": "", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">Organize the steps.</span>"}, {"time": "38000", "image": "", "id": 4, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">Use sequencing expressions.</span>"}, {"time": "63000", "image": "", "id": 5, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">Give details.</span>"}, {"time": "92000", "image": "", "id": 6, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">Go through instructions.</span>"}], "video_src": "engenn7le09ob04re4vid01"}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "video", "id": 2, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}]}